	(text "CONTENTS\n1   Cover: this page -- board description, contents, general notes\n2   Power: USB-C input (5 V sink), 3.3 V regulator, power LED\n3   MCU: ATtiny85, USB data lines, Qwiic I2C port"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 86.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "07e10c47-8015-493c-b2f3-8809d24ffcf7")
	)
	(text "NOTES\n1. Resistors 0402 1 %, capacitors 0402 X7R / X5R, unless noted.\n2. Capacitor values: capacitance, then the voltage rating where it matters (10u 25V).\n3. Net names in capitals; _P / _N are the two halves of a differential pair.\n4. Parts marked DNP are not fitted."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 132.08 86.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "23965583-f3b5-46e6-9faf-0a10c8bc572e")
	)
	(text "USB-C ATtiny85 board: USB-C powered ATtiny85 with a Qwiic I2C port.\n5 V from USB-C (a 5.1k Rd on each CC pin), AMS1117 to 3.3 V for the MCU and the I2C bus."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 22.86 0)
